<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom rises 2.62 percent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom rises 2.62 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunication Co Ltd (PTCL) rose 0.80 rupee, or 2.62 percent, to 31.30 on Wednesday after its global depositary receipt rate abroad closed at $73/76, up from $72/74.50, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some 1.22 million shares changed hands in early trade at the Karachi Stock Exchange , one dealer said, adding that the scrip was likely to gain further before the close.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
